  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Looking for a university in the heart of a vibrant city with a friendly campus community? The University of Nevada, Las Vegas (UNLV) could be the perfect fit for you. Located in one of the world’s most exciting cities, UNLV offers a diverse range of undergraduate and postgraduate programmes across Business, Engineering, Hospitality, Arts, Education, and more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At UNLV, you’ll be part of a lively student body with more than 400 student organisations. Whether you’re interested in academics, community service, sports, or entertainment, there’s a club or activity for you.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>UNLV offers several on-campus housing options, ranging from residence halls to suite-style apartments.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The UNLV Libraries are a great resource for your academic journey, offering extensive collections of books, journals, and digital media. The Lied Library is open 24/7 during the academic year, providing you with access to study spaces and research assistance.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>You can engage yourself in a range of recreational and competitive sports at UNLV. You can also be part of their NCAA Division I teams, nicknamed the Rebels, that compete in basketball, football, soccer, hockey, baseball, and other sports. You can also join the sports club at the university.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>You’ll find state-of-the-art labs across disciplines at UNLV, from hospitality and engineering to health sciences, supported by 55+ research centres and institutes.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>You can get fresh food at the dining commons, which offers an all-you-can-eat buffet-style dining spot. You can also get customised meal plans for your preferences.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
